include system.in.init
read_data system.data
include system.in.settings

velocity all create 50.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix relax all nve/limit 0.1
fix com all momentum 100 linear 1 1 1
thermo 200
thermo_style custom step temp pe press
timestep 1.0
run 5000
unfix relax

reset_timestep 0
velocity all scale 298.0
fix integrate all nvt temp 298.0 298.0 100.0
dump d1 all custom 5000 droplet.lammpstrj id type x y z
run 300000
write_data droplet_equil.data nocoeff
